                                                           ┃
   Make progress without leaving the TUI                   ┃
                                                           ┃
  Browse a problem, read its statement, open a solution    ┃
  in your editor, then test, submit and review.            ┃
                                                           ┃
  ## A first session                                       │
                                                           │
  1. Choose a pack and highlight a problem.                │
  2. Press v to read it without creating files, or Enter   │
  to create a missing solution template and copy its       │
  path.                                                    │
  3. Press e to edit, t to test examples, and s to judge   │
  and record a submission.                                 │
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

